@*
檔案整體說明

目的與定位：呈現核心服務已驗證的單一授權教會最近最多 200 筆設定稽核純值。
主要流程：Controller 每次 GET 重新解析登入 contact 與 account scope，store 先以教會條件查詢，
核心服務驗證正式稽核 ID、UTC 時間、唯一性與 200 筆上限後才交給本檢視；actor 只顯示 D365 顯示名稱。
輸出由 Razor 預設 HTML encoder 處理，不輸出帳號、contact ID、SDK Entity 或未驗證 raw HTML。
使用邊界與維護：模型只在當次回應使用，不保存 Session、快取、CRM 連線或背景工作，跨教會隔離由
Controller、store 與核心服務共同維持。修改後執行 ChurchReport 建置、指定隔離測試及文件／編碼檢查。
*@
@model System.Collections.Generic.IReadOnlyList<SpeechMessageProducts.GoodShepherd.Core.Settings.ChurchSettingsAuditRecord>
<h1>@ChurchSettingsText.GetText("ChurchSettings.AuditTitle")</h1>
@if (Model.Count == 0)
{
    <p>@ChurchSettingsText.GetText("ChurchSettings.NoRecords")</p>
}
else
{
    <table class="table">
        <thead><tr><th>@ChurchSettingsText.GetText("ChurchSettings.ChangedOn")</th><th>@ChurchSettingsText.GetText("ChurchSettings.Record")</th><th>@ChurchSettingsText.GetText("ChurchSettings.Field")</th><th>@ChurchSettingsText.GetText("ChurchSettings.Before")</th><th>@ChurchSettingsText.GetText("ChurchSettings.After")</th><th>@ChurchSettingsText.GetText("ChurchSettings.Actor")</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
        @foreach (var record in Model)
        {
            <tr data-audit-id="@record.Id" data-pseudo-locale-exempt="dynamic"><td>@record.ChangedOnUtc</td><td>@record.TargetRecordId</td><td>@record.Field</td><td>@record.Before</td><td>@record.After</td><td>@record.ActorDisplayName</td></tr>
        }
        </tbody>
    </table>
}
